<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Storage Dimensions.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Storage Dimensions.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Storage Dimensions Inc as a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- said expects Storage Dimensions to earn $0.67 a share in 1997 and $1.06 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $14 a share.</p>
<p>-- Storage Dimensions gained 3/8 to 6-1/4.</p>
</text>
